ArtEmotion-28 public data release
=================================

This repository contains two kinds of material, under different terms.


1. ANNOTATIONS  --  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything under annotations/ -- captions, emotion labels, split assignments
and accompanying metadata -- is released by the ArtEmotion-28 task organizers
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License.

You are free to:
  * Share  -- copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
  * Adapt  -- remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose,
              including commercially

Under the following terms:
  * Attribution -- You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the
    license, and indicate if changes were made.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Summary:           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution should cite the ArtELingo-28 dataset paper (see README.md) and
this shared task.


2. IMAGES  --  NOT RELICENSED
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The paintings under images/ are works by third parties, sourced from WikiArt
(https://www.wikiart.org).

These images are NOT covered by the CC BY 4.0 grant above. The ArtEmotion-28
organizers do not claim copyright in them and do not relicense them. They are
mirrored in this repository solely as a convenience for shared-task
participants, so that each team does not have to retrieve them independently.

All rights in the images remain with their respective rights holders. Anyone
intending to use these images beyond research on this shared task should
consult the terms applying to each work at its source.

If you are a rights holder and object to an image being mirrored here, please
contact the task organizers and it will be removed.


3. NO WARRANTY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The organizers and their affiliated institutions provide no warranties as to
the correctness or completeness of this dataset, and accept no liability
arising from its access or use.
